 "name_en": "Service Entry Sheet Based Accruals (63L)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Service Entry Sheet Based Accruals (63L)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio6486e4f9b97c4276a4fde63c98aea69a\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6486e4f9b97c4276a4fde63c98aea69a__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item lets you calculate and post accruals based on service entry sheets submitted against lean service purchase orders. You can replicate the lean service purchase orders as accrual objects based on service entry sheets submitted, but not yet approved, to propose the accrual amount. You can then review the accrual amount, generate periodic accrual journal postings, and reverse the documents in the next period.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6486e4f9b97c4276a4fde63c98aea69a__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Display automatically generated accrual objects</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Run job to propose accrual amount</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Review accrual amount</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Run job to post accruals to general ledger</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6486e4f9b97c4276a4fde63c98aea69a__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Automate the accrual process</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Provide more accurate accrual amount for lean service procurement scenario</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve financial process governance</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>基于服务条目表的应计 (63L)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio6486e4f9b97c4276a4fde63c98aea69a\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6486e4f9b97c4276a4fde63c98aea69a__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目允许您根据根据精简服务采购订单提交的服务条目表，计算和过账应计。您可以根据已提交但尚未批准的服务条目表将精简服务采购订单复制为应计对象，以建议应计金额。然后，您可以审核应计金额、生成定期应计日记账过账并冲销下一期间的凭证。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6486e4f9b97c4276a4fde63c98aea69a__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">显示自动生成的应计对象</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">运行作业以建议应计金额</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">审核应计金额</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">运行作业以将应计过账到总账</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6486e4f9b97c4276a4fde63c98aea69a__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">自动化应计流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">为精简服务采购场景提供更准确的应计金额。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">改善财务流程治理</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
